      "writtenOn": "2024-11-27T19:49:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem is, I don\u0027t think you can launch `bt_offload_socket_api` if `socket_settings_api` isn\u0027t also launched.\n\nFor example, `BluetoothSocketSettings` is guarded by `socket_settings_api` but there are methods guarded by `bt_offload_socket_api`.\n\nI don\u0027t think the infra supports this kind of dependency.",
